  "Stock cards and worked answers": "Amakhadi esitokhwe neempendulo ezisonjululweyo",
  "Sales and buyer balances": "Iintengiso namatyala abathengi",
  "Money cards and worked answers": "Amakhadi emali neempendulo ezisonjululweyo",
